        "actual_global_in_flight_peak": -1,
        "actual_batch_size_mean": -1,
        "static.variants.on.duplicate_segment_payload_fraction": 1
      },
      "note": "负向前缀信号针对当前 CacheBlend 需关闭 APC 的机制束；并发负向沿用当前实现的竞争路径假设。"
